      <h1>How hard is leaving Stocky? <span class="green">Score your store</span></h1>

    <p id="answer">This scorer works out how much of your store's history exists only inside Shopify Stocky, which closed on 31 August 2026: purchase orders, supplier records and stocktakes. It returns a risk band and the order to move things in, in about a minute. For the replacement options themselves, see <a href="/stocky-alternative/">the Stocky alternatives guide</a>.</p>

