      <p class="tool-hero-desc">Assess your migration risk from Shopify Stocky and get a personalised timeline while the read-only export window is open. Understand your complexity, urgency, and exactly what to do first.</p>
      <div class="tool-trust">
        <span>Stocky closed August 2026</span>
        <span>Free migration guide included</span>
        <span>60-second assessment</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

