            <strong style="color:#b6c0ba;">How this is scored.</strong> The risk score is this tool's own
            heuristic: six weighted inputs (monthly orders, active SKUs, manual stock edits, suppliers,
            purchase-order reliance and export habit), summed and capped at 100. The weights are a
            judgement about which of those hurts most when data disappears, not a measured model of
            migration outcomes, and no store's actual migration was used to fit them. Use it to rank your
            own situation, not to predict hours.
